  <item>
    <title>15. 紧绷人不懂松弛，但懂得自我安慰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6821764b24f855934621ad6c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6821764b24f855934621ad6c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>紧绷是放不下的心，是急促的呼吸，是感觉空间无限向自己压缩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>肉姐和蛋卷都是紧绷人，虽然我们不知道如何在运动时绷紧核心，但我们的心却总是难以放松。不管是出行还是社交，我们总像“手中紧握着鸡蛋”那样，在试图松弛和实际紧张中来回摇摆，从单一紧绷变成了多层次的，“不想让人看出来我紧绷的紧绷”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，欢迎走进肉姐和蛋卷的紧绷时刻，一起窥见被“拧紧琴弦”的生活，跟我们一起转移注意力，探讨如何与紧绷共存并且试图摆脱紧绷。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>🎙️主播</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>蛋卷，经常紧绷，偶尔松弛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>肉姐，经常松弛，偶尔紧绷</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>😵‍💫 这一期我们聊了这些内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 提前计划 vs 随遇而安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">03:22</a> “别人会不会觉得我...” vs “爱咋咋地”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> 面对尴尬和冲突的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 完美主义让人无法放松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a> 我们为什么这么紧绷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> 刻意追求松弛感，反而更让人紧绷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> 现在流行的“松弛感‌”是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2691">44:51</a> 松弛是不是“不匮乏”的副产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a> 信奉“天道酬勤”的社会里，“松弛感”有容身之地吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2871">47:51</a> 警惕松弛感暴政</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 一些能够让人放松一点点的小tips</span></p><span></span><h2><span>🎧 播客「打扰一下」</span></h2><span></span><p><span>我们谈论让人焦虑、疑惑和无语的话题，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但希望听众朋友们能天天开心！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66e37e3dba044d80fc9023e5/lnM9eVTHGt3nC39bKASTdtq8wWsK.m4a" length="51999274" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:35</itunes:duration>
